# Analyst Response Workflow

```text
DET-005 ALERT
       |
       v
Identify Group
       |
       v
Identify Added Member
       |
       v
Identify Actor
       |
       v
Validate Authorization
       |
       v
Review Account Creation
       |
       v
Review Authentication
       |
       v
Review Endpoint Activity
       |
       v
Review Other Alerts
       |
       v
Determine Scope
       |
       v
